``
Hmm wait — but line 1668's original is `workflowBudget.remaining <= 0` — hmm, careful: for merge-path rules it stays `remaining <= 0` ✓ (same via helper).

Where to define ruleBudgetRemaining? Module-level function (needs module-level tick state) — near the tick state vars. It references smRuleLayersModule + tickMerge* — fine.

Now the L1→L2 cache drop: note unarm_validation/silent-update ALREADY drop the cache on their mutations (3734 etc.)... wait does update_branch drop? Line 2679 is within update_branch (park SET path?). The drop happens at label mutations inside update_branch. But the silent REFRESH itself doesn't drop. So the loop-level post-L1 drop is needed ✓.

